# ── macOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*

# ── Media: ship only the web-optimised versions ─────────────────────
# The originals (4K exports, Insta downloads, raw screenshots) stay on
# your Mac. They total ~167 MB and git would keep them FOREVER, even
# after deletion — so they never get committed in the first place.
#
# This works as an allow-list: everything in img/ and video/ is
# ignored, then the optimised files are added back.
#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT: a new image must be named  preview-*.webp
#     and a new clip must be named  clip-*.mp4
#     or git will silently skip it and the live site will 404.

img/*
!img/logo-*.webp
!img/ozii-*.webp
!img/preview-*.webp

video/*
!video/clip-*.mp4

# ── Editor / tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
node_modules/
*.log
